## Practical 8: Basic Cell Culture Workflow

### Objective
- To understand the basic workflow involved in maintaining cultured cells.
- To learn fundamental principles of cell culture handling.

### What to Learn
- Cell culture laboratory setup
- Culture vessels
- Growth medium
- Cell seeding
- Cell attachment
- Cell confluency
- Cell passaging
- Cryopreservation


### Practical Work
Learn and observe the general workflow:

```text
Cell thawing
     ↓
Cell recovery
     ↓
Cell seeding
     ↓
Cell growth
     ↓
Microscopic observation
     ↓
Confluency assessment
     ↓
Passaging
     ↓
Further culture / cryopreservation
```

### Expected Outcomes
- Understanding cell-culture workflow
- Recognizing cell confluency
- Basic cell-culture terminology
- Contamination awareness
